d UNCONDITIONAL: these kernels are the implementation, so the","+    # consultation gates on the private mask instead of the user-facing"],"additions":39,"deletions":0,"truncated":false}],"additions":532,"deletions":2,"truncated":true,"file_count":11},"error":null,"fetched_at":"2026-09-05T11:49:53.110476+00:00"}